==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - head:
      "10":
        - type: javascript
        - attributes:
            type: text/javascript
        - inline: console.log("Hello World!")
==== explainer ====
Inline JavaScript source. Use a normal YAML string, or a YAML block scalar when the source spans multiple lines.
==== expected json ====
